    ["//[转发人B]：描述"] = "//[Forwarder B]: Description",
    ["1.立旗后我方进度初始为满，站在<Highlight>旗帜范围内</>的我方成员将根据存活时间持续获得积分。\n2.此外，<Highlight>击败或助攻击败非凡者</>同样可获得积分。\n3.宣战时间结束后，<Highlight>积分高的一方获胜</>。积分相同时，<Highlight>被宣战方</>获胜。\n4.当敌方进入旗帜范围内，且<Highlight>敌方人数多于我方</>时，进度条将逐渐变为敌方进度。"] = "1. After planting the flag, our progress starts at full. Our members standing <Highlight> within the flag's range </> will continuously gain points based on their survival time. \n 2. In addition, <Highlight> defeating or assisting in defeating Beyonders </> can also earn points. \n 3. After the declaration of war ends, <Highlight> the side with higher points wins </>. If the points are the same, <Highlight> the side that was declared war upon </> wins. \n 4. When the enemy enters the flag's range and <Highlight> the number of enemies is greater than ours </>, the progress bar will gradually turn into the enemy's progress.",
