    ["<Assistant_Title1>【城堡模板】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>使用说明：</>\n打开<Assistant_System>菜单-城堡-模板-推荐</>页签，或{JumpToUI:[点击这里]|1250327}，即可浏览并下载推荐模板。\n打开<Assistant_System>菜单-城堡-模板-我的</>页签，选择已保存的模板后，点击<Assistant_System>应用模板</>，即可将模板应用到当前城堡。\n在<Assistant_System>城堡-装修界面-保存/应用</>中，也可以应用已保存的模板，或将当前城堡装修保存为模板。\n<Assistant_Title2>小提示：</>\n你还可以前往<Assistant_System>装扮广场</>查看其他玩家上传的模板，喜欢的模板可以保存后使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>删除模板：</>\n如需删除已保存的模板，可前往<Assistant_System>菜单-城堡-模板-我的</>，选中目标模板后，点击<Assistant_System>右上角</>的删除按钮进行删除。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Castle Template】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Instructions: </>\nOpen the <Assistant_System>Menu - Castle - Template - Recommended</> tab, or {JumpToUI:[Click Here]|1250327} to browse and download recommended templates. \nOpen the <Assistant_System>Menu - Castle - Template - My</> tab, select a saved template, and click <Assistant_System>Apply Template</> to apply it to your current castle. \nIn the <Assistant_System>Castle - Decoration Interface - Save/Apply</>, you can also apply saved templates or save your current castle decoration as a template.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tips: </>\nYou can also go to the <Assistant_System>Decoration Plaza</> to view templates uploaded by other players; you can save and use the ones you like.\n<Assistant_Title2>Delete Template: </>\nTo delete a saved template, go to <Assistant_System>Menu - Castle - Template - My</>, select the target template, and click the delete button in the <Assistant_System>top right corner</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【好友-好友列表】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-好友</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>好友上限：</>本服好友上限200个，跨服好友拥有独立的分组，上限为50个。\n<Assistant_Title2>范围设置：</><Assistant_System>好友-右上角设置</>可以设置在线状态可见范围，可选择全部在线、全部隐身、对谁隐身、部分可见4个状态。并可以在设置中，调整可见范围和隐身范围。若群聊中有非好友关系的玩家，则该范围设置不生效。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友分组：</><Assistant_System>菜单-好友</>下方，点击<Assistant_System>创建分组</>可以创建自定义好友分组，最多可创建6个分组。创建分组后，可以通过<Assistant_System>管理分组</>进行排序和快捷删除操作。\n<Assistant_Title2>俱乐部成员：</>此分组列表默认显示非好友关系的当前俱乐部成员。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}，{SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}，{SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}，{SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}，{SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}，{SendAnswer:[好友-删除拉黑]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Friend List】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Limit: </>The friend limit for this server is 200. Cross-server friends have a separate group with a limit of 50.\n<Assistant_Title2>Visibility Settings: </><Assistant_System>Friends - Settings in the top right corner</>You can set the visibility of your online status. There are 4 available states: All Online, All Invisibility, Invisible to Specific Players, and Partially Visible. You can also adjust the visibility and invisibility ranges in the settings. If there are players in a group chat who are not on your friend list, these visibility settings will not take effect.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Groups: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>At the bottom, click <Assistant_System>Create Group</> to create custom friend groups. You can create up to 6 groups. After creating a group, you can use <Assistant_System>Manage Groups</> to sort or quickly delete them.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Members: </>This group list displays current Club members who are not on your friend list by default.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}",
    ["<Highlight>防护职业</>需要站在瑞尔比伯<Highlight>前方</>，开启减伤技能并替其他玩家阻挡射线伤害，<Highlight>治疗职业</>也要注意观察防护职业的血量。"] = "The <Highlight>Protection class</> needs to stand in <Highlight>front of Riel Bieber</>, activate damage reduction skills, and block ray damage for other players. <Highlight>Healing classes</> should also pay attention to the health of the Protection class.",
    ["<Highlight>非凡物质</>：带有非凡力量的物质，可以填充入封印物来稳定历史投影，并解锁更多额外的非凡效果（非凡共鸣）。\n<Highlight>随机词条</>：非凡特性的力量量化为词条，不同非凡物质由于构成的非凡特性序列与数量不同，词条数量、类型与强度会有不同。最少有1条词条，最多可以达到6条词条，超过6条词条的非凡物质暂时未被发现。\n<Highlight>异变词条</>：非凡物质的随机词条受高位格力量影响或污染，可能会出现异变，异变词条相对于普通词条，会带来更为强大的效果。异变词条在单个非凡物质上最多出现1条。"] = "<Highlight>Beyonder Material</>: A material containing Beyonder power that can be filled into a Sealed Artifact to stabilize a historical projection and unlock additional Beyonder effects (Beyonder Resonance).\n<Highlight>Random Traits</>: The power of a Beyonder characteristic is quantified into traits. Due to the different sequences and quantities of Beyonder characteristics that compose them, different Beyonder materials will have different numbers, types, and strengths of traits. There is at least 1 trait, and up to 6 traits can be reached. Beyonder materials with more than 6 traits have not yet been discovered.\n<Highlight>Mutated Traits</>: The random traits of a Beyonder material may be affected or corrupted by high-level power, potentially leading to mutations. Compared to ordinary traits, mutated traits bring more powerful effects. A single Beyonder material can have at most 1 mutated trait.",
