    ["减免受到伤害的攻击基础值，无法减免伤害的技能基础值。\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的防御超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>，与对方<Highlight>破防</>、<Highlight>忽视防御</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Reduces the base Attack value of received damage; cannot reduce the base Skill value of damage. \n The base Attack value after reduction has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 20% </>; if the increased Defense exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage reduction capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Armor Break </> and <Highlight> Ignore Defense </> attributes.",
