    ["暴雨夜，阿芬公爵遇刺，城堡聚集了五位继承人。神像诅像诅咒悄然苏醒....像诅咒悄然苏醒...."] = "On a stormy night, Duke Affen was assassinated, and five heirs gathered at the castle. The statue's curse quietly awakened....",
