    ["永久定身40码内的所有普通敌人。"] = "Permanently immobilize all normal enemies within 40 yards.",
    ["没人知道这双靴子从哪里来，至少年轻女孩从古董店里偷来时不知道。\n“能卖个好价钱。”买她的男人把这句话和黑面包一起丢给她。\n但靴子的花纹实在太漂亮，她偷偷把靴子留下，在大家都入睡后拿出来穿，自此她夜夜好梦：行走在汹涌的波涛之上，在无人驻足的沙漠起舞，飞跃上一望无际的雪山。\n她一直讨厌又脏又小的床铺和十几个孩子齐鸣的呼噜，但好在她也一直长不高，靴子一直合脚。\n这天她挨了打，不顾男人的叫嚷冲回房间套上靴子。\n白光刺得她睁不开眼，往日的美景，在白天尤为炫目。\n“都是真的！”她兴奋地跳起来，和风一起融化在雪中。"] = "No one knew where these boots came from, at least not the young girl who stole them from an antique shop. \n \"They'll fetch a good price.\" The man who bought her threw this sentence at her along with a piece of black bread. \n But the patterns on the boots were so beautiful that she secretly kept them, taking them out to wear after everyone had fallen asleep. From then on, she had wonderful dreams every night: walking upon surging waves, dancing in a desert where no one ever stopped, and leaping onto endless snowy mountains. \n She had always hated the dirty, cramped bed and the snoring of a dozen children, but fortunately, she never grew tall, and the boots always fit. \n One day, she was beaten and, ignoring the man's shouting, rushed back to her room to put on the boots. \n The white light was so piercing she couldn't open her eyes; the familiar beautiful scenery was even more dazzling in the daylight. \n \"It's all real!\" She jumped up excitedly and melted into the snow along with the wind.",
